      "hash": "a27078bfc6b5fd60b2c2ea51e3db5de7f1f14bf68278506ea5f18e4af3301a43"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c8ed69db83b1fe83f55e06c12bb105531daed275650a679a4f9d7f94f28159e",
      "text": "AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "29a768799acab15b5a0ee28f241b6e057d0b5ff706c70c3edf7f24676f3d77a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad64dd1b5e0dda9911fa1237b264e12317e30969b165c450daf7fc6a098bf258",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "d3daa2d39e5d81d6ae46219d99adbb53cba0b1e037b904c6122a847f215177fb",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "6636d0f9717db242c422f1f1c1072da0ecaee234e3ddb6636c76088f0c6af487",
      "text": "Tools & Environment",
      "hash": "cf9194302814cf2bb2ae04f0e1023fec3d18acdc5258a0e00c18bb7df366cf00"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6c4f34fe86c3767a05de45d873632428ef26f638dd57592beef7eca16c05d5b",
      "text": "Sandbox",
      "hash": "67fc62497e85d81bc54ea07aa87dca6868cd470e95d7281155a8eb532ce60009"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7237f4af189993781e4c4a95d70b47d8aa62e7f3838c8360cc85f4272b84415",
      "text": "An isolated environment the agent runs inside — container, VM, or restricted shell. Limits the blast radius of agent actions.",
      "hash": "a57e4fdf9556c49d5778453404b48b57a6192c9f43702091e5e58db8dcde551b"
    },
    {
      "id": "c15e18aa6a87a449689e9ae3308166c9b1c6961517580edb2ec5b7c2b46c45ce",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "89d5f516ab7925cc30443cd5d48cb0757b3a7807af273864867a4f2615f1ab73",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3f45b218745c65e37640fc5497cea94d02e17310ed6198a2eef29e2e6a45579",
      "text": "An isolated",
      "hash": "176c851cb5e20d7f83c48ae93a9a709bdad52e88ac711130f5dc39e541b4692a"
    },
    {
      "id": "26f5be84de95e98f3eb4214efc580d179359814f728c3df170b7139f109d15bd",
      "text": "runs inside — a container, VM, ephemeral",
      "hash": "f7eea6cc75a58e167a481dd8587decec214776fd9686320bce142c1fa8149f5e"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2ee639e1498a9c69f0697629ad33677f57989f7a67e0ee65a6206abdf94362e",
      "text": ", or restricted-permission shell. Limits the blast radius of agent actions: even if the agent runs destructive commands or fetches something malicious, the damage is contained. The safety substrate that makes",
      "hash": "7c4899bb8db0eb53b3acbd4df3c0da9846dbe0846e9cd95bb38b070e2b6c47af"
    },
    {
      "id": "49b0f87f8e8e1da41baf2b3b38f552024a6354c235e124f9bf240c823aea3ac8",
      "text": "AFK",
      "hash": "875e0577157f743e3346ba95f1d944d08e54b3cab40d89819dff5f48cd507392"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c3268d48557e21a90e8615b193bdf65c8923bb0a5384a498763681d5f74ea66",
      "text": "practical.",
      "hash": "79503a6a491a835d63a85af06e5ee9a7ddb4d82639effd282ca889badfb2c06c"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec0d20a9c9ddce950b6448d96e64e97478c312771e758e8f1d1cb4fb5d2edc8c",
      "text": "The sandbox and the",
      "hash": "7ca157f35eeaa2d9d40fed49686cdc97668d03880d4baee9cdbbaddfea4515ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "8b46b974838f92bca0c8141eef51a669429ec0194877314660a271de662e8e41",
      "text": "permission mode",
      "hash": "2ea04b3cff63e2308414a5e48abbef0b69336f0b9902d10bd8b81d8ff46aae26"
    },
    {
      "id": "bd4f2ee7ea0bd474d4ed1690c248878d3d9361e2c46513838556c54df09f1132",
      "text": "solve the same problem from opposite ends. Permissions ask before an action runs; a sandbox limits what the action can reach if it does run. Permissions need you running",
      "hash": "f6fcd1e6ae38ac3241d476b2aea94e6ffb73697a7ed46266259b82396562027b"
    },
    {
      "id": "054ab58e2d54f847a10cb1be1ac29941371dc52eb2a10f943d682eed63aa8fa4",
      "text": "in the loop",
      "hash": "1668c1fbd2d432d2c76d5e6bacdcaab43416d3881f33d919a09825de57faf55f"
    },
    {
      "id": "dfe90ac724d34e8f3ae250b853b652fca8727fef3bc8dd68d809b28528e243b6",
      "text": "— every prompt is an interruption — and a session that asks constantly is barely autonomous. A sandbox spends infrastructure instead of attention: the stronger the isolation, the fewer questions need asking.",
      "hash": "ff7a8c8f6cc260d54ae07f667f5ea2c468a6cc0f077d3158a41fad1660eb6e2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "059822d43be2c8cf535fa508f2e5fcea48522eb30b273f335a99b18d9558712d",
      "text": "Isolation comes in grades:",
      "hash": "b969536c208a475d38bd717becfdd26a4c0d7bc1429ad310a854fadfb4969447"
    },
    {
      "id": "96efc4605afcdbdb04334bbfdae51cb405c3d06e7f2839801b9c6f99b13251ff",
      "text": "Grade",
      "hash": "839e20fb3599fc744d2b45386afdcc0091db03733269fceb25c89f37474a8478"
    },
    {
      "id": "a37873eb6fbf19b0ea7cdd01c3a46c7b0d1429e4c684796ba8da16ba93d586f3",
      "text": "What it is",
      "hash": "1f36becc3aa7c8a8893bc0688d52b8bef91dae5528528706003bc4f45e409f96"
    },
    {
      "id": "17a5952e226074efb5898380e97ea3aa8c9f97658071a154371c965e133537be",
      "text": "What it contains",
      "hash": "d857ce6edcd58ff2d9fb9b4daf73ff9d868c5735121c2d485b6a6c6b577029ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "907d59ce02adf2a73926fd7ffa18662145fdc4a690a88be8c33db4b3b01a2f4b",
      "text": "Restricted shell",
      "hash": "d0e49b1441f73effd361113cb3c743e1793bf2f1108ade5783534761d225d18d"
    },
    {
      "id": "887930e9e91619fb7e1cc3f4e78e7de516c11f9c55fc01c4a252c5b089d5e69c",
      "text": "OS-level confinement around each command",
      "hash": "db8ec3ff4f112a5e89a9094293cb23e022408118930ae495be9f80fd230495ac"
    },
    {
      "id": "49120d52fff5f5718c6e463d8ccb60e3ec40bcf48c2599e17c79644ae5005ab0",
      "text": "Writes outside the project, network access",
      "hash": "0f5c755f653a61273904225e10824b20dca730b9db3607ccbe4e24e3565dc2a4"
    },
    {
      "id": "5c8d3fbe701f6c6345ebe3ddc5a2354ee82bcd452e9067e3554072923f6b16dc",
      "text": "Container",
      "hash": "0c7823e8c759af7d0d04bea22a6d64fb56065c7168977b5f19ad2225a2986178"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a12ec513f04ea36660215bcef9efa0cb90d63a80de6bd1914cc7f60dc046222",
      "text": "Fresh filesystem, no credentials mounted, discarded after",
      "hash": "a355f7d82bff7ab2b76dcef3f34e63b933efedb2d592a637caa260a4ea91d807"
    },
    {
      "id": "02ad792cc4a90084cc825a6afad5400aeab6fcfd2f97b2cf65f69b8161775ee7",
      "text": "Anything the agent does to its own machine",
      "hash": "546d1c16d1fe3c677b57a5a02b1e41114008a3ad4fc0672162caea8cc2ec8469"
    },
    {
      "id": "24cfeb5fd9dfd5b427437f2947c98229a93f9ada0feb90dd634dbd9e9ea95fcd",
      "text": "VM / cloud",
      "hash": "09b105c9eb7bec4236d46fa4761a33a86bb1a3a2af5c78928c121567850ca4de"
    },
    {
      "id": "11a05459bf8f950b6a6e796ce94b552319a473078c22b7966181c900cf705911",
      "text": "A separate machine entirely, often provided by the harness",
      "hash": "e5144e88b77a46ee3fa3b53d1f38cd4e2f7901bca2aa23fc1bea24ff4e32d5bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "94e6b0841cdc366415e1f163280a1825690449b7ccfdf9af55bdd1eadcaa94a1",
      "text": "Everything, including kernel-level escapes",
      "hash": "0865af56e6acbb9b621b4e2d3d656f8af9dc180c07595c33216ab9545ad3726f"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3a3d5101ffd24977070be6d6bd5b298a20c24e075818b919c8ce5ece7419bf3",
      "text": "View Table",
      "hash": "aa0a0f6baf57a603925533ee10fab7f6bb4e7002e7d8df106b2bc671e1d72567"
    },
    {
      "id": "ee65ad30e147d610366ea6bea2b3bb6e85768a37f0752ca072a72945fc533fce",
      "text": "What no sandbox contains: actions that leave it legitimately. An agent with your git credentials can push; one with network access can call production APIs. Decide what crosses the boundary before deciding how thick to make it.",
      "hash": "63b0759b22b163bab0288436add2f8ffa6f32e4375990cf71529670ca8d6bf63"
    },
    {
      "id": "4ebb8f56a7b9eb99a52bdf1cd8ea8888d0e534d70ba3b9115ce2f97cef030a7f",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "757ecf904c3cea3f91c478b596219e702e85e295870b39edfae9c4223fcd7217",
      "text": "\"I want to let it run",
      "hash": "de44f3b33965021dd1052d3a392fd35f3d941cdf7bfdfda7e4a5ffb048843b23"
    },
    {
      "id": "9cedaf45f81497d140876d6449d524b7cf5aade8cdc41deac5f5b4f2938c52a7",
      "text": "overnight but I'm not ready for that.\"",
      "hash": "9e8e5c8bb3e24233bd38a7bf28ba9cee29a6df266bfd5ae28b0090a810a87d4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "659853d4f5aa3113d046e1eaa2cab383a584cfe5e4c6f80c6c709df622c95dbb",
      "text": "\"Put it in a sandbox — fresh container, no credentials mounted, no network out. Worst case it nukes its own filesystem and you discard the container.\"",
      "hash": "ca5f85ee02111f16bce15a1929d4b11fc09651bbae6c2ee2a6e611b52ba06ec6"
    },
    {
      "id": "7cf12ec9b0a65aa0da924d35f99a24b84af793dc8cc01da50d3b6bd607ca8d40",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c66dd5e3e64a3589cc1d1c33db439ddf643b27caf67322354517d7101d3fd405",
      "text": "Agent mode",
      "hash": "7cb0154423f4e208531c0ab32537384bffd7b92ace440743085f715a3a9042b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "b23c77f4cfa936b6e353b59779da87cd2a3a66697734b2788816a04009a4dd21",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "80aab17ced1a925d9f86a1adfead1c12d62d44bc0909a5080eaa6ed279d8c405",
      "text": "Sycophancy",
      "hash": "3ea44487a35802429565ace3d346af85ffa355f51322456406c67ae05fbe8aa5"
    },
    {
      "id": "adf87e0b31eae747aaf6c691e40b1765f24d44d8c40ff4e0e5c7733008d348a2",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "9375c5d7bf53159d671756ff4a40e415959ee1de23c798205a37c681626cfe69",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea32d297b5bef4cbbb7823726319c752050049cc779f5988c864869963015f70",
      "text": "First Name",
      "hash": "96ce6e6193a047260f5c32aa416d88b6e8959111f43f98457af9cc009a0907ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b9f6ad9dc2cbaf133c98d178fed7557654107b1314ed3660a7b934ff5cb568c",
      "text": "Email*",
      "hash": "61dff02026341a6e553a56fc2ba214a76ad68c18cc67bf732993cfdbd51bb8b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c870c98983373aa32733feba8082c020694823cd9fba9e3e34c61a0b0c2016c",
      "text": "Get AI Hero updates",
      "hash": "81b46eab414c141d6dcd85a5bd534179bf54a3532469436d693c437e9de3a90a"
    },
    {
      "id": "62bf9e861d0ede00987ca7d1c13e384ef0d0a8d5c51eb32442aaef57d16798db",
      "text": "No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.",
      "hash": "461f8758206b36fd4ddfaf6740b33dc0de41c9c7acb9121525993b781d5e18bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "237402a3126e03a973afeab983dd7134cce34264eb6bba41f1ac8b08fd1ff5df",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "0733210b12bad7b7f92d7cfd3513033d36375495c69a5a8a08e063c6519c5d54",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "55fd224a8c8e9e08875655dc6e68a89ac19cbfcf40eec6f29cdcd9aec52c1c0d",
      "text": "Learn",
      "hash": "ce78afd0e6a225ecac96a6812b9d192e7eb35889cd5237beb38b50375b79d8dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ddc3c15865cac9adca05ceb2a8d01dd88a2c2681ddc760983953541bdab6dc0",
